docs {
  # Revenue Leakage Agent API

  Black-box tests of the HTTP API (D40 in `docs/design.md`), run over real HTTP against the
  scripted mock backend (`AGENT_BACKEND=mock`, D29). The contract is in `docs/api.md`.

  Run them with `make api-test` (starts a fresh mock on port 8200, environment `ci`). To explore
  by hand in the Bruno app, start `make dev AGENT_BACKEND=mock` and pick the `local` environment.

  The folders run in order and share the server: the mock keeps the audit log in memory, so
  every flow that applies an action rolls it back before it ends, and the settings folder
  restores the defaults. IDs that depend on the server's history (`INV-MG-NNN`, the settings
  `version`) are captured into variables and compared, never hard-coded.
}
